Bluetooth (bt_drv, OPPO MT6765 bt/) on Linux 5.10, applied to the staged tree by
tools/prepare-connectivity-sources.py (patches.applied in connectivity-sources.json).

- ioremap_nocache to ioremap (5 sites), the bt_dbg procfs file_operations to proc_ops.
- PM_QOS_CONTROL stays off, as stock.
- bt_dbg: the handlers stock does not have (AP register read and write, audio_cr_debug, and
  _bt_audio_cr_dbug) and their table entries 0x9, 0xa and 0x11 are under BT_DBG_OPPO_EXTRA, which
  is not defined, so the table has 0xf entries as stock.

